    "directions": [
      "In a pressure cooker, add ghee, once it's hot, add ginger, green chillies, garlic and saute it for a minute.",
      "Add chickpeas, salt to taste, ghee, water as required, black cardamom, black peppercorns and mix it well.",
      "Cover it with a lid and give it 3-4 whistles until cooked well on medium flames.",
      "Leave it aside for 8-10 minutes to depressurise the cooker.",
      "Divide the cooked chole into two separate bowls and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a mixer grinder jar, add black peppercorns, black cardamom, dry fenugreek leaves and grind it into fine powder.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a mixer grinder jar, add green chillies, ginger, tender coriander stem, garlic and grind it into a smooth paste.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a mixer grinder jar, add onions and grind it into a smooth paste.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a handi, add oil, ghee, once it's hot, add dry red chili, coriander seeds, cumin seeds, prepared ginger garlic paste and saute it for a minute.",
      "Add onion paste and cook it for 4-5 minutes until golden brown on medium flames.",
      "Add coriander powder, turmeric powder, fresh tomato puree, curd and cook it for a while until cooked well.",
      "Add salt to taste, cooked chole, remaining mashed cooked chole, sugar and let it simmer for a while until thick.",
      "Finish it with fresh coriander leaves, prepared masala and give it a quick boil.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish, garnish it with ghee, tomato wedge, green chili, coriander sprig, ginger julienned and lemon wedge.",
      "Serve hot with roti."
    ],
